2 CONC he domkapital (Chapter House) of the Stavanger diocese.  Olav complained that Gudrun had left him and taken their property out of his control.  She answered that she wouldn't live with him because he had taken away her keys to the
2 CONC  house, which she as the mistress of the household should have, and besides he had physically abused her.  Despite the serious complaints from both sides, the case ended with reconciliation.  The Domkapital admonished them to live
