2 CONC he could no longer live with him as she feared for her life.  She asked the Domkapital to grant a divorce so she could live secure and happy in her old age.  Olav admitted that he had hit her once, but that was because she had ass
2 CONC aulted him with his own dagger. But it was her word against his and neither had any witnesses.  The Domkapital then realized that they could not live together in peace, so it was decreed that they should live apart for one year.  
