2 CONT
2 CONT Ståle Vrålsen Egeland was born before 1520 at Egeland ytre, Kvinesdal, Vest Agder, Norway. He died in 1584 at Egeland ytre, Kvinesdal, Vest Agder, Norway. He is mentioned Kvinesdal II.28, Feda 611. Austad 296.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Mentioned 1553-1584.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources: Åmli, Kvinesdal III 125
