2 CONT Location of [https://www.norgeskart.no/#!?project=seeiendom&layers=1002,1014,1015&zoom=13&lat=6522142.05&lon=-14814.31&markerLat=6522142.05352285&markerLon=-14814.311597917578&p=searchOptionsPanel&showSelection=false&sok=sv%C3%A5l
