1 NAME Eiel Knutson /Nesheim/
2 GIVN Eiel Knutson
2 _MARNM Nesheim
2 NICK Egil
2 NICK Baustad
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1604
2 PLAC Nesheim 
2 ADDR
