1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://forum.arkivverket.no/topic/370045-folk-og-%C3%A6tt-p%C3%A5-agder-7-t%C3%A5ler-denne-slektstavlen-en-kritisk-gjennomgang/
2 CONT
2 CONT Vrål was from Ytre Egeland, Kvinesdal, and lived at Møskeland, Lyngdal.  He owned parts of several farms in Kvinesdal, Lyngdal, Feda, and Bjelland.  He was bondelensmann in Lyngdal from about 1616 to his death around 1626.  Årli, 
2 CONC Kvinesdal, 14-5. Lian, Lyngdal II 542.
