2 CONT
2 CONT Sveigenes Seland, Caspersdotter.
2 CONT
2 CONT Born about 1580 in Sveigenes i Feda (Bygdebok for Nes herad 1.bind).
2 CONT
2 CONT Moved to Seland i Gyland (Bygdebok for Nes herad 1.bind).
2 CONT
2 CONT *****
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Jon OLSEN Seland. She is mentioned Nes I p. 497, Kvinesdal. I. p. 569.
