2 CONT He is listed in the tax records at Hauge farm from 1613 until 1652. His son, Peder Åsulvsen, is listed in 1653.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Lived at Hauge, Sokndal, and Botne på Heien, Hidra. (source: Signe Elisabeth Zijdemans)
