2 CONT In "odelsjordeboka" from 1661 Ole Bjørheim is listed as the owner of 10 "merker smør" at Øvre Bjørheim, 1/2 "laup smør" and 4 "spann korn" in Egland, Årdal and 1/2 "laup smør" at "Hoffueland".  They lived at Øvre Bjørheim in 1664.
2 CONC   Anna and th e son Knut later moved to Høyland, and the next farmer came to Bjørheim from Høyland.
