2 CONT Birgitte Hansdtr Gullestad was born at Gullestad, Kvinesdal, Vest Agder, Norway. She married Ånen Sigbjørnsen Refsti. She died before 1666 at Refsti, Feda, Vest Agder, Norway. She is mentioned Feda 339. Lista I. 576. Kvinesdal II.
2 CONC  82.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ånen Sigbjørnsen Refsti was born at Refsti, Feda, Vest Agder, Norway. He married Birgitte Hansdtr Gullestad, daughter of Hans Andersen Gullestad and Ragnhild (--?--). He han var eier av 1 hud i Seland i Gyland, han var også eier a
2 CONC v Krossli in 1649.  (He he was the owner of 1 skin in Seland in Gyland, he was also owner of Krossli in 1649).  He died before 1666 at Refsti, Feda, Vest Agder, Norway. He is mentioned Feda 131.Lista I. 576. Kvinesdal II. 82.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
