2 CONT
2 CONT Sirdal III.364.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kvås 133.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gunsten Vermundsen Årstøl was born before 1580 at Årstøl, Fjotland, Vest Agder, Norway. He was living in 1594 at Årstøl, Fjotland, Vest Agder, Norway. He married Siri Håversdtr Undeland, daughter of Håvar (--?--) Undeland. He left
2 CONC  a will on 16 Nov 1666 at Årstøl, Fjotland. He died after 1666 at Tjørnhom, Kvinesdal, Vest Agder, Norway. He is mentioned Fjotland 321,Kvinesdal II.248.297,Sirdal III.364.
2 CONT
2 CONT Siri Håversdtr Undeland was born at Undeland, Kvås, Vest Agder, Norway. She married Gunsten Vermundsen Årstøl, son of Vermund (--?--) (69138). She died in 1666 at Årstøl, Fjotland, Vest Agder, Norway. She oldebarn av Ånen Suege. S
2 CONC he is mentioned Fjotland 321.Kvinesdal II.248,297.Kvås 133.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
