2 CONT https://www.nb.no/items/be2286fb5cc7a5901189ec9923923351?page=92&searchText=«Torbjørn%20Tusth»
2 CONT
2 CONT Per bygdebok, she first married Knut Fredriksen Lindland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  Guri's father was a Torbiorn - perhaps the Torbjorn Oloffson "Tusth" who owned 1 hud 6 engelsk iin Skjepstad in 1647 (per skattematrikkel); that Torbjorn Oloffson also farmed 1 hud 6 engelsk in Halsaa. Per a bygdebok - he was b.1
2 CONC 564 at Halse.
