1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Probate record (07-12-1759; Ole had died, and the heirs were listed as the widow, Anna Toresdatter; his 2 children with her (Anne Olsdatter, and Barbra Olsdatter); and his 2 children with his first wife (Torkel 
2 CONC Olsen Li, and Isak Olsen). It is also noted that the second wife had 3 children with her first husband (Tore Karlsen, Anne Karlsdatter, and Kristi Karlsdatter)):'''
2 CONT Lister sorenskriveri, AV/SAK-1221-0003/H/Hc/L0034: Skifteprotokoll nr 32a med register, 1754-1761, s. 596b-597a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081031330631
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Probate record (07-12-1759; Ole had died, and the heirs were listed as the widow, Anna Toresdatter; his 2 children with her (Anne Olsdatter, and Barbra Olsdatter); and his 2 children with his first wife (Torkel Olsen Li, and Is
2 CONC ak Olsen). It is also noted that the second wife had 3 children with her first husband (Tore Karlsen, Anne Karlsdatter, and Kristi Karlsdatter)):'''
2 CONT Lister sorenskriveri, AV/SAK-1221-0003/H, s. 31165. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk11214091231167
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Reference: Book
2 CONT
2 CONT Gyland 402, Kvinesdal I. 422.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kv.II.562.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kvinesdal I.422.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ole Torkelsen Gjemlestad was born in 1668 at Gjemlestad, Kvinesdal, Vest Agder, Norway. He married Anna Thomasdtr Rødland, daughter of Thomas Isaksen Egeland and Susanne Henriksdtr Schurmann Stavanger, before 1700. He married Anne
2 CONC  Torsdtr Sandsmark,
2 CONT
2 CONT daughter of Tore Toresen Sandsmark and Guri Sigbjørnsdtr Seland, after 1715. He died in 1759 at Rødland, Kvinesdal, Vest Agder, Norway. He left a will on 7 Feb 1759. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne Torsdtr Sandsmark was also known as Anna Torkelsdtr Sandsmark. She was born circa 1685 at Sandsmark, Bakke, Vest Agder, Norway. She witnessed the will of Tore Toresen Sandsmark on 23 Feb 1696 at Sandsmark ytre. She married Ca
2 CONC rl Andersen Konstali, son of Anders Tollaksen Sandsmark and Mette Carlsdtr Hove. She married Ole Torkelsen Gjemlestad, son of Torkel Olsen Gjemlestad and Anna d.e. Torkelsdtr Drange, after 1715. She died after 1766 at Rødland, Kvi
2 CONC nesdal, Vest Agder, Norway. She witnessed the will of Tor Carlsen Konstali and Anna Olsdtr Åros on 6 Jun 1766 at Århus. 
