1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Reference: Book
2 CONT
2 CONT Lyngdal II. 625.
2 CONT
2 CONT Reference: Book
2 CONT
2 CONT Lyngdal I. 128.
2 CONT
2 CONT Austad 429.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lyngdal I.128.
2 CONT
2 CONT Austad II.429,425.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lensmann Lars Madsen Eigeland was skipper, lensmand. He was born circa 1656 at Eigeland indre, Lyngdal, Vest Agder, Norway. He married Randi Salvesdtr Kvålsvik, daughter of Salve Stillufsen Kvålsvik and Torborg Tronsdtr ?  He marr
2 CONC ied Ragnhild Torbjørnsdtr ?  circa 1712. He died before 1717 at Langøy østre, Spind, Vest Agder, Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT Randi Salvesdtr Kvålsvik was born at Kvålsvig, Austad, Vest Agder, Norway. She married lensmann Lars Madsen Eigeland, son of Mads Olsen Berghøydna and Berte Rasmusdtr Eigeland. She died before 1712 at Eigeland nedre, Lyngdal, Vest
2 CONC  Agder, Norwa
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Ref. Lyngdalsboka bind 1, side 128.
