2 CONT
2 CONT  F  Ingeborg REINERTSEN (AFN:1V9P-GJC)  Pedigree  
2 CONT
2 CONT  Born:  Abt 1712   Place:  Helgevoll, Sandeid, Rog, Norway  
2 CONT
