1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 336. Gunnar Rasmusson, son of Rasmus Gunnarson and Bergitte Larsdotter, was born in 1633 in Tjelmeland, Sand, Rogaland, NOR and died circa 1697 in Høyland, Etne, Hordaland, NOR at age 64.  Gunnar married Anna Tjera
2 CONC ndsdotter circa 1654 in Stødle kyrkje, Etne, Hordaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children from this marriage were:
2 CONT
2 CONT i.  Styrkår Gunnarson was born in 1658 in Høyland, Etne, Hordaland, NOR and died in 1710 in Lunde øvra, Ølen, Hordaland, NOR at age 52. Styrkår married Karen Larsdotter circa 1684 in Ølen kyrkje, Ølen, Hordaland, NOR. They had no 
2 CONC children. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ii.  Lars Gunnarson was born in 1660 in Høyland, Etne, Hordaland, NOR and died in 1717 in Ås, Sand, Rogaland, NOR at age 57. Lars married Mari Torkelsdotter circa 1686 in Sand kyrkje, Sand, Rogaland, NOR. They had no children. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 168     iii.  Christen Gunnarson. Christen married Kari Knudsdotter circa 1692 in Vikedal kyrkje, Vikedal, Rogaland, NOR. 
2 CONT
