2 CONT * '''Born:''' 15 Apr 1657, Sjernarøy, Rogaland, Norway [2]
2 CONT * '''Marriage:''' Berete Valentindtr. TALGJE in 1694    
2 CONT * '''Died:''' 11 Oct 1732, Sjernarøy, Rogaland, Norway at age 75
2 CONT * '''Spouses/Children:''' 
2 CONT ** Berete Valentindtr. TALGJE 
2 CONT *** Asgaut Olson REILSTAD+
2 CONT *  '''Notes:''' alternative farm Hidle. Ola Aasgautson Hidle  [http://suesinclair.net/Sonsteby_ahnentafel.htm]
2 CONT
2 CONT * Ola '''married''' Berete Valentindtr. TALGJE, 
2 CONT ** daughter of Valentin Børgeson Ubøe På TALGJE and Maren Mikkelsdtr. ALANTZ, in 1694. 
2 CONT ** (Berete Valentindtr. TALGJE was born in 1675 in Sjernarøy, Rogaland, Norway [3] and died in 1713.)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources:'''
